## Encoder checkpoints

The bundled training lineage descends from CorentinJ's Real-Time-Voice-Cloning
(<https://github.com/CorentinJ/Real-Time-Voice-Cloning>, MIT), specifically its
speaker-encoder training and GE2E objective.

Licence notes for each distributed weight are recorded in
`models/registry.json` alongside the weight itself, because the constraints
differ per weight and a single blanket statement would be misleading.
